    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>18th-level Study of Affliction feature</em></p><p>You learn a curse of impending doom. As a bonus action, you place the curse on one creature you can see within 60 feet. At the end of each creature's turn, the target creature takes [[/damage 1d4 psychic]] damage. This damage increases by 1 for each turn after the first.</p><p>After the target takes damage from this curse six times, or when the creature dies, the curse ends and a doomguard appears within 5 feet of the cursed target, or the nearest available space.</p><p>The doomguard acts on the turn immediately after yours and obeys your commands (no action required) for 1 minute or until killed or dismissed as a bonus action, after which it disappears.</p><p>Once you have use this ability, you cannot do so again until you finish a long rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
